# The kernel series, the staging scripts and the tooling are applied and run by
# POSIX shells and `git apply` on Linux/macOS runners: a CRLF working tree (the
# Windows default with core.autocrlf=true) makes `set -euo pipefail` fail with
# "invalid option name" and turns every patch context line into a mismatch.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.bin binary
*.img binary
*.dmg binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.lz4 binary
*.elf binary
*.kext binary
